  p_embed:'Pega este script antes de 
 <div id="tab-citas" class="tab">
  <div class="tab-topbar">
   <div class="tab-topbar-title">Gestion de Citas</div>
   <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Confirmaciones · Recordatorios · Cancelaciones · Reagendamientos</div>
  </div>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px">
   <div class="metric"><div class="v" id="cita-stat-confirm" style="color:#4ade80">0</div><div class="l">Confirmaciones enviadas</div></div>
   <div class="metric"><div class="v" id="cita-stat-remind" style="color:#f97316">0</div><div class="l">Recordatorios enviados</div></div>
   <div class="metric"><div class="v" id="cita-stat-noshow" style="color:var(--gold)">0</div><div class="l">No-shows evitados</div></div>
   <div class="metric"><div class="v" id="cita-stat-cancel" style="color:#3B82F6">0</div><div class="l">Cancelaciones gestionadas</div></div>
  </div>
  <div id="cita-booking-banner" style="display:none;background:rgba(249,115,22,.08);border:1px solid rgba(249,115,22,.2);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:12px;color:#f97316;align-items:center;gap:10px">
   <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16" style="flex-shrink:0"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
   <span>No tienes un link de citas configurado. <button onclick="tab('config')" style="background:none;border:none;color:#f97316;text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;padding:0;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-weight:600">Agregalo en Configuracion</button> para que las variables <code style="color:var(--gold)">{link_reserva}</code> funcionen.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="camp-grid">

   <div class="cita-card" id="cita-card-confirm">
    <div class="cita-hdr" onclick="toggleCitaOpen('confirm')">
     <span class="cita-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="18" height="18"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg></span>
     <div style="flex:1"><div class="cita-name">Confirmacion de cita</div><div class="cita-desc">Mensaje instantaneo cuando se agenda una nueva cita.</div></div>
     <label class="camp-toggle" onclick="event.stopPropagation()"><input type="checkbox" id="cita-confirm-enabled" onchange="updateCitaStat()"><span class="camp-track"></span><span class="camp-thumb"></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="cita-body">
     <span class="cita-badge cita-badge-confirm">Trigger: cita creada</span>
     <div class="camp-channels">
      <button class="camp-ch camp-ch-wa camp-ch-on" onclick="setCampChannel('cita_confirm','whatsapp',this)">
       <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="12" height="12"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"/></svg>
       WhatsApp
      </button>
      <button class="camp-ch camp-ch-sms" onclick="setCampChannel('cita_confirm','sms',this)">SMS</button>
      <button class="camp-ch camp-ch-ig" onclick="setCampChannel('cita_confirm','instagram',this)">
       <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="12" height="12"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"/></svg>
       Instagram
      </button>
     </div>
     <input type="hidden" id="camp-cita_confirm-channel" value="whatsapp">
     <label style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Mensaje de confirmacion</label>
     <textarea id="cita-confirm-msg" style="min-height:90px;font-size:12px;margin-top:6px">Hola {nombre}, tu cita ha sido confirmada.

Fecha: {fecha}
Hora: {hora}
Servicio: {servicio}
{negocio}

Si necesitas cancelar o reagendar, escribenos aqui mismo.</textarea>
     <div class="camp-vars" style="margin-top:6px">Variables: <code>{nombre}</code> <code>{fecha}</code> <code>{hora}</code> <code>{servicio}</code> <code>{negocio}</code> <code>{link_reserva}</code></div>
     <button style="font-size:12px;padding:6px 16px;margin-top:8px" onclick="saveCita('confirm')">Guardar</button>
    </div>
   </div>

   <div class="cita-card" id="cita-card-reminder_24h">
    <div class="cita-hdr" onclick="toggleCitaOpen('reminder_24h')">
     <span class="cita-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="18" height="18"><path d="M18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M13.73 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.46 0"/></svg></span>
     <div style="flex:1"><div class="cita-name">Recordatorio 24 horas antes</div><div class="cita-desc">Reduce no-shows recordando la cita el dia anterior.</div></div>
     <label class="camp-toggle" onclick="event.stopPropagation()"><input type="checkbox" id="cita-reminder_24h-enabled" onchange="updateCitaStat()"><span class="camp-track"></span><span class="camp-thumb"></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="cita-body">
     <span class="cita-badge cita-badge-remind">Trigger: 24h antes de la cita</span>
     <div class="camp-channels">
      <button class="camp-ch camp-ch-wa camp-ch-on" onclick="setCampChannel('cita_reminder_24h','whatsapp',this)">
       <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="12" height="12"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"/></svg>
       WhatsApp
      </button>
      <button class="camp-ch camp-ch-sms" onclick="setCampChannel('cita_reminder_24h','sms',this)">SMS</button>
      <button class="camp-ch camp-ch-ig" onclick="setCampChannel('cita_reminder_24h','instagram',this)">
       <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="12" height="12"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"/></svg>
       Instagram
      </button>
     </div>
     <input type="hidden" id="camp-cita_reminder_24h-channel" value="whatsapp">
     <div style="margin-bottom:10px">
      <label style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Pedir confirmacion de asistencia</label>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:4px">
       <input type="checkbox" id="cita-reminder_24h-confirm_req" style="width:auto;margin:0">
       <label for="cita-reminder_24h-confirm_req" style="font-size:12px;color:#aaa;margin:0;cursor:pointer">Si — esperar respuesta "Confirmo" / "Cancelar"</label>
      </div>
     </div>
     <label style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Mensaje de recordatorio</label>
     <textarea id="cita-reminder_24h-msg" style="min-height:90px;font-size:12px;margin-top:6px">Hola {nombre}, te recordamos que manana tienes cita con nosotros.

{fecha} a las {hora}
{servicio}
{negocio}

Responde CONFIRMO para confirmar tu asistencia o CANCELAR si necesitas reagendar.</textarea>
     <div class="camp-vars" style="margin-top:6px">Variables: <code>{nombre}</code> <code>{fecha}</code> <code>{hora}</code> <code>{servicio}</code> <code>{negocio}</code></div>
     <button style="font-size:12px;padding:6px 16px;margin-top:8px" onclick="saveCita('reminder_24h')">Guardar</button>
    </div>
   </div>

   <div class="cita-card" id="cita-card-reminder_2h">
    <div class="cita-hdr" onclick="toggleCitaOpen('reminder_2h')">
     <span class="cita-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="18" height="18"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg></span>
     <div style="flex:1"><div class="cita-name">Recordatorio dia de la cita</div><div class="cita-desc">Aviso final el mismo dia, antes de la hora de la cita.</div></div>
     <label class="camp-toggle" onclick="event.stopPropagation()"><input type="checkbox" id="cita-reminder_2h-enabled" onchange="updateCitaStat()"><span class="camp-track"></span><span class="camp-thumb"></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="cita-body">
     <span class="cita-badge cita-badge-remind">Trigger: X horas antes de la cita</span>
     <div class="camp-channels">
      <button class="camp-ch camp-ch-wa camp-ch-on" onclick="setCampChannel('cita_reminder_2h','whatsapp',this)">
       <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="12" height="12"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"/></svg>
       WhatsApp
